==Norwegian Bokmål==

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|nb|non|fár}}

====Adjective====
{{head|nb|adjective|neuter singular|få|definite singular and plural|få|comparative|færre|indefinite superlative|færrest|definite superlative|færreste}}

# [[few]]
#: ''Hun syntes hun fikk '''få''' gaver til jul.''
#:: ''She thought she got few presents for Christmas.''
#: ''De '''færreste''' vet om hendelsen.''
#:: ''Very few know of the incident.'' (literally: ''the fewest know of the incident'')

=====Synonyms=====
{{top2}}
* {{l|nb|enkelte}}
* {{l|nb|fåtall}}
* {{l|nb|et par}}
* {{l|nb|fåtallig}}
{{mid2}}
* {{l|nb|noen}}
* {{l|nb|sparsom}}
* {{l|nb|spredt}}
{{bottom}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|nb|fåfengt}}
* {{l|nb|fåtall}}
* {{l|nb|fåtallig}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{der|nb|non|fá}} (to [[grab]], [[capture]], [[conquer]]), shortening of obsolete {{der|nb|non|fanga}}, from {{der|nb|gml|}}. Compare ''[[fange]]'' and other verb shortenings (ganga --> [[gå]], standa --> [[stå]]).

====Verb====
{{head|nb|verb|imperative|få|present tense|får|passive|fås|or|fåes|simple past|fikk|past participle|fått|present participle|fående}}

# to [[get]]; to have; to [[obtain]]; to [[receive]].
#: ''Be, så skal dere '''få'''. Let, så skal dere finne. Bank på, så skal det lukkes opp for dere.'' (''The Bible, Matt. 7,7'')
#:: ''Pray, and you shall '''receive'''. Search, and you shall find. Knock, and the door shall be opened to you.''
#: ''Hva '''fikk''' du til jul?''
#:: ''What did you get for Christmas?''
#: ''Hvor mange fisk '''fikk''' du?''
#:: ''How many fish did you get?''
#: ''Det beste er godt nok, bare man kan '''få''' det.'' (''proverb'')
#:: ''The best is good enough, if only one can '''get''' it.''
# (''as an auxiliary verb'') to get done; to [[accomplish]]
#: ''Husk å '''få''' gjort leksene!''
#:: ''Remember to '''get''' your homework done!''
# {{lb|nb|medicine}} to get; to [[catch]]; to [[aquire]]
#: ''Jeg '''får''' hodepine av alt det bråket!''
#:: ''All that noise is giving me a headache!'' (literally: ''I'm '''getting''' a headache from all that noise'')
#: ''Han '''fikk''' en alvorlig skade.''
#:: ''He '''got''' a serious injury''.
# (''as an auxiliary verb'') [[will]]; [[have to]]; [[better]]
#: ''Det '''får''' vente.''
#:: ''It '''will have to''' wait.''
# (''as an auxiliary verb'') [[may]], [[can]], [[be allowed]]
#: ''Pasienten '''får''' ikke ta imot besøk.''
#:: ''The patient is not '''allowed to''' have visits.''
# (''as an auxiliary verb'') [[shall]], [[will]]
#: ''Vi '''får''' se hva som skjer.''
#:: ''We''''ll''' see what happens.''

=====Synonyms=====
* (''to get, obtain, receive'') {{l|nb|erholde}}, {{l|nb|erverve}}, {{l|nb|innhente}}, {{l|nb|innkassere}}, {{l|nb|motta}}, {{l|nb|oppdrive}}, {{l|nb|oppebære}}, {{l|nb|oppnå}}, {{l|nb|skaffe}}, {{l|nb|skaffe seg}}, {{l|nb|ta hjem}}, {{l|nb|tilegne seg}}, {{l|nb|tjene}}, {{l|nb|vinne}}
* (''to catch, aquire'') {{l|nb|bli rammet av}}, {{l|nb|bli til del}}, {{l|nb|bli utsatt for}}, {{l|nb|pådra seg}}
* (''may, can; shall, will'') {{l|nb|måtte}}, {{l|nb|skulle}}

