==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/foː/}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-få.ogg|audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|sv|gmq-osw|fār}}, from {{der|sv|non|fár}}, from {{der|sv|gem-pro|*fawaz}}.

====Adjective====
{{sv-adj|färre|[[minst]] ([[färst]])}}

# {{senseid|sv|few}} [[few]]

=====Usage notes=====
The superlative form {{m|sv|färst}} is extremely rare and was considered extinct for the whole 20th century. Usually, “''minst''” is used, or, when used as a noun, a rewording on the lines of “det [[minsta]] [[antal]]et” (literally: “the least number of”, or “the smallest number of”) is done.

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|sv|många}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|fa|fā}}, from {{inh|sv|non|fá}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*fanhaną}}, whence also German {{m|de|fangen}}, Dutch {{m|de|vangen}}.

====Verb====
{{sv-verb-irr|får|fick|fått|få}}

# to [[get]], to [[receive]]
#: {{ux|sv|Jag '''fick''' paketet idag.|I '''got''' the package today.}}
#: {{ux|sv|Han '''fick''' 'nej' som svar.|He '''got''' a 'no' for an answer.}}
# to be [[allowed]] to, [[may]]; to have the opportunity to
#: {{ux|sv|Du '''får''' ta så många du vill.|You '''may''' take as many as you want.}}
# to be forced to, to [[have to]]
#: {{ux|sv|Om ingen annan vill, '''får''' jag göra det själv.|If nobody else wants to, I'll have to do it myself.}}
# to get, to cause to happen, to make someone to do something
#: {{ux|sv|'''Få''' ut honom därifrån!|'''Get''' him out of there!}}
#: {{ux|sv|Pavlov '''fick''' hundarna att dregla när middagsklockan ringde.|Pavlov '''made''' the dogs salivate when the dinner bell chimed.}}
# {{lb|sv|with an adverb}} to [[manage]] to do something, often to cause a movement (in a figurative or literal sense)
#: {{ux|sv|Vi kan inte '''få''' upp låset: det har rostat fast.|We can't '''get''' the lock to open: it has rusted shut.}}
#: {{ux|sv|Regeringen '''fick''' igenom bugeten efter en lång debatt.|The government '''got''' the budget past [parliament] after a long debate.}}
# to [[get]]; to cause to become; to bring about.
#: {{ux|sv|Jag hoppas jag hinner '''få''' det här gjort innan lunch.|I hope I have time to '''get''' this done before lunchtime.}}
# to get; to catch a disease
# to get; to catch out, trick successfully.
# to get; to catch (e.g. fish, game, a criminal)
#: {{ux|sv|Hur mycket fisk '''fick''' ni?|How much fish did you '''get'''?}}
# to get (as an answer)
# to [[score]]; to achieve a test score

